## Environment overrides for temp-monitor service
## Uncomment and edit to send to multiple subnets or specific hosts.
##
## Comma-separated list of broadcast or unicast addresses.
## Examples:
## TEMP_MONITOR_TARGETS=192.168.1.255,192.168.2.255
## TEMP_MONITOR_TARGETS=10.0.0.10,10.0.0.11
# TEMP_MONITOR_TARGETS=

# Optional shared secret. When set here and in the MagicMirror module config,
# packets without the same secret will be ignored.
# TEMP_MONITOR_SHARED_SECRET=
